including compiled effect bundles and material streams, served without
modifying the installed game's files on disk. Asset Redirect v2
(`asset_redirect.lua` and `asset-redirect.dll`) is sourced from Wobin's
Polychromatic 1.0.1 project: https://github.com/Wobin/Polychromatic .
